{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The process starts with BUSINESS PROCESS REQUIREMENTS, followed by SAP Configuration."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and captures the first two sequential steps described in the opening unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, it moves on to Communications Design. Then, it proceeds to Learning Design. Next, it involves Data Conversion Design & Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the three design and test activities listed in this segment."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the SAP Configuration is completed, it moves on to IT Design, Development & Functional Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to the step following SAP Configuration; missing comma in the model is a trivial typographical variation that does not alter behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "action:n10",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Similarly, after Communications Design, it moves on to Communications Deployment. After Learning Design, it proceeds to Learning Deployment. Following Data Conversion Design & Test, it moves on to Integration Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the deployment and test steps that follow their respective design phases."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Similarly, after Communications Design, it moves on to Communications Deployment. After Learning Design, it proceeds to Learning Deployment. Following Data Conversion Design & Test, it moves on to Integration Test.",
        "Once IT Design, Development & Functional Test is completed, it proceeds to Integration Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the join point where the Data Conversion and IT Design/Test tracks synchronize before entering Integration Test."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After Communications Deployment, it moves on to Deployment. Similarly, after Learning Deployment, it proceeds to Deployment. Following Integration Test, it moves on to Deployment."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the final unified deployment step and the convergence node that aggregates all parallel streams."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, after Deployment, it enters the PRODUCTION SUPPORT phase, and the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the concluding operational phase and explicit process termination."
    }
  ],
